<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 12790 0 R/Alt(Two block diagrams. (a) clk_i enters a clock divider, whose output slow_clk_q, drawn in red, goes to the clock input of a register. The register output led_o is fed back through an inverter to its D input. (b) clk_i goes to a tick generator and to the clock input of the register. The tick generator output tick goes to the enable input EN of the register, whose output is fed back through an inverter to D as in (a).)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 31611 0 R>>
endobj
