<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 13669 0 R/Alt(Two rows, each with two dashed macro outlines A and B side by side. Row (a): a register in A feeds logic in A, which feeds an output port, a wire to an input port of B, logic in B, and a register in B. The whole chain from register to register is red. Row (b): in A, a register feeds logic and a second register, which drives the output port. In B, the input port feeds a register, then logic and a last register. Each register-to-register path stays inside one macro.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 31620 0 R>>
