15118 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 15119 0 R/Alt(Four panels side by side, each with a column of four storage entries numbered 0 to 3 from top to bottom. Occupied entries are filled blue and show their value. An arrow labeled rd points at an entry from the left, an arrow labeled wr from the right. Panel (a), empty: no entry occupied, rd and wr both at entry 0, rd = 0 00, wr = 0 00. Panel (b), 3 entries: entries 0 to 2 hold 11, 22, 33, rd at 0, wr at 3, rd = 0 00, wr = 0 11. Panel (c), full: all four entries hold 11, 22, 33, 44, rd and wr both at entry 0, rd = 0 00, wr = 1 00. Panel (d), 2 entries: entry 3 holds 44 and entry 0 holds 55, rd at 3, wr at 1, rd = 0 11, wr = 1 01.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[31]/Pg 31634 0 R>>
