18937 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 18938 0 R/Alt(Four standard-cell layouts on a white background in a two-by-two grid, all of the same height and at the same scale: a narrow inverter with one vertical red poly stripe that crosses two green active areas, a wide inverter with sixteen such stripes joined by a horizontal poly bar, a multiplexer with six stripes, and a wide flip-flop with many stripes and dense blue Metal1 wiring. Blue Metal1 rails labeled VDD and VSS run along the top and the bottom edge of every cell, a dark green outline marks the n-well in the upper half, and a legend explains the layers.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[11]/Pg 31669 0 R>>
endobj
