<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 21718 0 R/Alt(Four rows of block diagrams with registers as narrow blue boxes, pipeline registers as narrow red boxes, and logic as green boxes. Row a, before: register R1 drives logic A (2 ns) and logic B (2 ns) in series into register R2, and an operand x from a second input register enters B, longest path 4 ns. Row a, after: a pipeline register sits between A and B, and x passes through its own pipeline register before B, longest path 2 ns, one more cycle of latency. Row b, before: R1, logic A (2 ns), logic B (1 ns), register R2, logic C (1 ns), register R3, longest path 3 ns. Row b, after: R1, logic A (2 ns), register R2, logic B (1 ns), logic C (1 ns), register R3, longest path 2 ns.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 31710 0 R>>
