25951 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 25952 0 R/Alt(Two panels with the same scattered dots in a band about 180 micrometers wide and 45 micrometers high, colored by register: data_q blue on the left, out_q red mostly on the right, shamt_q green and mode_q yellow in between. In the top panel, labeled by instance name, as without placement: 3024 micrometers, a gray line connects the dots with many long jumps across the band. In the bottom panel, labeled after the placement: 911 micrometers, the gray line connects mostly neighboring dots: it runs from the left edge to the right, back to the middle, and then jumps about 100 micrometers to the right edge, where it ends.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 31761 0 R>>
endobj
